# The installer's texts that reach kl_tr through a variable (tools/i18n/tr.py reads this with the source).
# Why a disk or its partitions cannot be chosen (disk.c inst_disk_refusal and inst_chosen_refusal, drawn with kl_tr(reason)).
msg	The running system uses this disk.
msg	This disk is read-only.
msg	This disk is a file, not a device.
msg	This disk's sector size is not supported.
msg	This disk is too small.
msg	The disk has no GPT partition table.
msg	The disk's partition table cannot be edited here.
msg	The disk's partition table is full.
msg	Another installation of this system may be on this disk.
msg	The disk's EFI system partition cannot be read.
msg	The disk's EFI system partition is too small or cannot be used.
